<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1200" height="970" viewBox="0 0 1200 970" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc"><title id="title">V4.1-Flash Engram：主干位置与条件记忆查找流程</title><desc id="desc">左侧从下向上为 Vocab Embedding、前面的 Transformer blocks、Engram、Attention、MoE。右侧从 token ID 规范化开始，构造 2、3、4-gram，多头哈希查表、拼接，投影为 Key 和 Value。当前隐藏状态与 Key 形成门控，调制 Value 后加入主干残差。V4.1 已移除原版短卷积。本图展开一个残差分支。</desc><defs><marker id="arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6.2" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L7 3.5L0 7Z" fill="#343434"/></marker><marker id="purple" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6.2" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L7 3.5L0 7Z" fill="#855a9a"/></marker></defs><style>text{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC',sans-serif;fill:#262626}.wire{fill:none;stroke:#343434;stroke-width:1.8;marker-end:url(#arrow)}.memory{fill:none;stroke:#855a9a;stroke-width:2;marker-end:url(#purple)}.zoom{fill:none;stroke:#91998e;stroke-width:1.3;stroke-dasharray:5 5}</style>
